  "update_count": 56,
  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nIt is possible to use m_currentSpeechUtterance variable of SpeechSynthesis.cpp, after it is freed.  \n  \nTest Case:  \n<script>  \nspeechSynthesis.speak(new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(\"Hello\"));  \nspeechSynthesis.cancel();  \nwindow.gc();  \nspeechSynthesis.cancel();  \n</script"
}